    "title": "Bible Word Cross Puzzle",
    "description": "A brand new bible word cross game!\r\n\r\nThousands of Bible Verses waiting for you to collect.\r\n\r\nTrain your brain and test your Bible knowledge by playing the crossword game.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Swipe the letters to find the right hidden word.\r\n- Solve the word puzzles to unlock complete sentences containing these words in the Bible.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- More than 3000 levels is waiting for you,\r\n- More than 1000 Bible verse to collect.\r\n- Beautiful visual experience.\r\n- Suitable for both kids and adults.\r\n\r\nDownload the MOST addictive bible word puzzle game and PLAY it NOW for FREE!",
